/tools/
*.log

# Backups. scripts/backup.mjs already refuses to write inside this repository,
# but this repository is public and a database of bank history is not something
# to leave guarded by a single check. Belt and braces.
#
# Deliberately NOT `*.sql`: the Flyway migrations are .sql files and must stay
# tracked. `restore.mjs --out` writes decrypted financial data, so send it
# outside the repository, or name it `*.restored.sql`.
*.sql.enc
*.restored.sql
backups/
